. Asking for a bribe as proof of authenticity. Wow.","words":[{"w":"That's","s":158.687,"e":159.465},{"w":"diabolical.","s":159.465,"e":160.505},{"w":"Asking","s":160.825,"e":161.225},{"w":"for","s":161.225,"e":161.385},{"w":"a","s":161.385,"e":161.465},{"w":"bribe","s":161.465,"e":161.865},{"w":"as","s":161.865,"e":162.105},{"w":"proof","s":162.105,"e":162.345},{"w":"of","s":162.345,"e":162.505},{"w":"authenticity.","s":162.505,"e":163.385},{"w":"Wow.","s":163.705,"e":164.307}]},{"speaker":"Zendaya","start":164.607,"end":172.548,"text":"So Poisson pays. The sale, the bribe, everything. Lustig takes the money, packs a suitcase, and is on a train to Vienna within hours.","words":[{"w":"So","s":164.607,"e":164.825},{"w":"Poisson","s":164.825,"e":165.385},{"w":"pays.","s":165.385,"e":165.865},{"w":"The","s":165.865,"e":166.265},{"w":"sale,","s":166.265,"e":166.745},{"w":"the","s":166.745,"e":166.825},{"w":"bribe,","s":166.825,"e":167.385},{"w":"everything.","s":167.385,"e":167.705},{"w":"Lustig","s":168.27,"e":168.75},{"w":"takes","s":168.75,"e":168.99},{"w":"the","s":168.99,"e":169.15},{"w":"money,","s":169.15,"e":169.47},{"w":"packs","s":169.47,"e":169.79},{"w":"a","s":169.79,"e":169.95},{"w":"suitcase,","s":169.95,"e":170.51},{"w":"and","s":170.51,"e":170.59},{"w":"is","s":170.59,"e":170.75},{"w":"on","s":170.75,"e":170.91},{"w":"a","s":170.91,"e":170.99},{"w":"train","s":170.99,"e":171.15},{"w":"to","s":171.15,"e":171.31},{"w":"Vienna","s":171.31,"e":171.71},{"w":"within","s":171.71,"e":172.03},{"w":"hours.","s":172.03,"e":172.548}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":172.848,"end":175.866,"text":"And now the poor man realizes he's been taken for a ride.","words":[{"w":"And","s":172.848,"e":172.99},{"w":"now","s":172.99,"e":173.15},{"w":"the","s":173.15,"e":173.31},{"w":"poor","s":173.31,"e":173.55},{"w":"man","s":173.55,"e":173.79},{"w":"realizes","s":173.79,"e":174.35},{"w":"he's","s":174.35,"e":174.67},{"w":"been","s":174.67,"e":174.83},{"w":"taken","s":174.83,"e":175.1